      "name": "Rishabh",
      "created_at": "2026-03-18T14:08:08.486Z",
      "cooked": "<p>HI,</p>\n<p>I am trying to move stock from one warehouse to another and need to create eway for the same. Currently we have sales order mandatory to create delivery.</p>\n<p>I have seen in multiple post that we can create delivery and assign eway based on that but that is not correct.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eway needs to be generated on stock entry with material transfer document</li>\n<li>If I create delivery then, there is no way to link delivery and stock entry.\n<ul>\n<li>As sales order is mandatory in my case. I won’t be able to create delivery w/o sales order</li>\n<li>It looks like a jugaad instead of process.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Can anybody refer me to the documentation for eway with stock transfer from one warehouse to another.</p>",
