      "username": "Lakshit_Jain",
      "name": "Lakshit Jain",
      "created_at": "2026-03-19T12:21:29.545Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If it is under same GSTIN, e-Waybill is directly supported from Stock Entry.</p>\n<p>You can enable it from GST Settings.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/docs/ewaybill-and-einvoice/generating_e_waybill#supported-doctypes-to-generate-e-waybill\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/docs/ewaybill-and-einvoice/generating_e_waybill#supported-doctypes-to-generate-e-waybill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">docs.indiacompliance.app</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/387;\"><img src=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/logo.jpg\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/docs/ewaybill-and-einvoice/generating_e_waybill#supported-doctypes-to-generate-e-waybill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Supported DocTypes to generate e-Waybill ​ - e-Waybill Management - ERPNext...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>e-Waybill is an electronic waybill required to be generated on e-Waybill Portal for the movement of goods. India Compliance offers multiple ways to manage your e-Waybill compliance. | Learn how to manage e-Waybills in ERPNext, including generation,...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/3/13fbbcbcd35905a82d9aca0cf91ab23d29495c9d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/13fbbcbcd35905a82d9aca0cf91ab23d29495c9d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/3/13fbbcbcd35905a82d9aca0cf91a